  "instructions": [
    "In a large bowl, whisk together the flour, baking powder, and salt",
    "In a separate bowl, whisk together the sugar, eggs, and milk",
    "Add the wet ingredients to the dry ingredients and stir until just combined",
    "Fold in the chopped pistachios",
    "Heat the oil in a deep frying pan to 350 degrees",
    "Using a cookie scoop, drop the batter into the oil and fry until golden brown",
    "Drain the fritters on paper towels and fill with jam while still warm",
    "Serve the fritters warm and enjoy"
